---
description: Project conventions — read AGENTS.md before every task
alwaysApply: true
---

Before starting any task, read `AGENTS.md` at the repo root. It tells you which files to read and which rules to follow.

The doc hierarchy is: **SPEC.md wins** over DESIGN.md, which wins over UI.md. When they disagree, the spec wins.

Work only from a GitHub issue that is in Ready. Stop and ask if an assumption looks wrong, an open question blocks the work, or the work would change a decision (`D-…`).
